  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialTrigger
  message: 'OBSTACLE DETECTED.


    There are obstacles the path, destroy them to
    move ahead.


    INSTRUCTION:


    Use Drone [RMB] to FREEZE the Obstacle.


    Move
    close along with a heat over 50% and use Robot [E] to SMASH it.


    DOOR LOCK
    MECHANISM: This door is powered by local fuseboxes on the walls.


    INSTRUCTION:


    Use
    Drone [RMB] to FREEZE the fusebox.


    Move close along with a heat over 50%
    and use Robot [E] to SMASH it.


    Destroy all connected fuses to open the
    door.'
